  "historyNote": "#6830, INTERIM, eff 8-14-98, EXPIRED: 12-12-98 New. #6941, eff 1-30-99, EXPIRED: 1-30-07 New. #12163, eff 5-1-17; ss by #14010, eff 6-27-24",
